  {
   "type": "events",
   "id": "587491",
   "attributes": {
    "id": 587491,
    "title": "Tour and technical presentations at Hellbender's new facility",
    "description": "<p>Join the Pittsburgh IEEE Robotics and Automation Society at the Pittsburgh Robotics Network Open House at Hellbender. Hellbender is a Pittsburgh Robotics company that specializes in vision and AI. They also design and build hardware for several Pittsburgh area companies. They have moved into a new larger facility. The evening will include networking, technical presentations, and tours.</p>\r\n<p>To attend the event, you need to register on both Vtools and with the event at <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/robotics-tech-happy-hour-hellbender-open-house-tickets-2003512690390\">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/robotics-tech-happy-hour-hellbender-open-house-tickets-2003512690390</a></p>\r\n<p>Register with a company name of IEEE and your present work title and select the free PRN member ticket option.</p>\r\n<p>Check in with Ralph Sprang at the event to receive credit for attendance.</p>",
    "start-time": "2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z",
    "end-time": "2026-11-18T02:00:00.000Z",
    "time-zone": {
