    "title": "IEEE Young Researchers Café October 2026 Edition",
    "description": "<p>Join us for a friendly meet-up where students, early-career researchers, and young professionals can connect, exchange ideas, and find inspiration.&nbsp;This edition features an expert talk on Intellectual Property Law, followed by an open discussion. It is a great opportunity to ask questions and share perspectives on this important topic that many people may be unfamiliar with. This event is in association with the Department of Law, TalTech School of Business and Governance.&nbsp;<br><br></p>",
